  "description": "VURMIH crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H64 Dy4 N12 O20,4(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1C (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.880-3.880 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 109.49-113.34°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(L)4(μ2-CH3O)4]·CH3OH (C65H68Dy4N12O21; H2L = N′-(2-hydroxy-3-methoxybenzylidene)-6-(hydroxymethyl)picolinohydrazide).",
